     "flexcontaineritem_2": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/flexcontaineritem",
      "title_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "jcr:title": "Smarter Depth, Smarter Vision",
       "type": "h2",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
      },
      "text_1": {
       "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
       "text": "<p>Toppan products bring advanced 3D time-of-flight (ToF) sensing technology to robotics, automation, and next-generation devices. Leveraging decades of semiconductor expertise and its patented <b>hybrid ToF™</b> architecture, Toppan delivers sensors and cameras that combine <b>long-range</b> <b>accuracy, high resolution, and strong ambient light tolerance.&nbsp;</b>Macnica Americas partners with Toppan to make these ToF solutions accessible to OEMs and developers across North America, providing local expertise, design services, and integration support.</p>",
       "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
       "textIsRich": "true"
      }
     }
    }
   },
   "container_2": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
